{"id":"aa2ad816ed17d60f","group":"91","path":"91/91-cor-truth-theory-hierarchy.md","title":"固定版本的算术保守类与严格链","display":"cor-truth-theory-hierarchy — 固定版本的算术保守类与严格链","type":"corollary","metadata":{"type":"corollary","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-cor-truth-theory-hierarchy","aliases":["91-cor-truth-theory-hierarchy","91-cor-theory-strength-hierarchy","91-cor-strength-ordering"],"display":"cor-truth-theory-hierarchy — 固定版本的算术保守类与严格链","depends_on":["[[91-fact-theory-comparison]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"corollary"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-cor-truth-theory-hierarchy"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-cor-truth-theory-hierarchy</span><span>91-cor-theory-strength-hierarchy</span><span>91-cor-strength-ordering</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"cor-truth-theory-hierarchy — 固定版本的算术保守类与严格链"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d0dc2670ffdd2806\" href=\"?note=d0dc2670ffdd2806\" title=\"91-fact-theory-comparison\">91-fact-theory-comparison</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C=\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\">\\(\\mathcal C=\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PA},\\mathrm{TB},\\mathrm{UTB},\\mathrm{CT}^{-},\\mathrm{FS},\\mathrm{KF},\\mathrm{VF}\">\\(\\mathrm{PA},\\mathrm{TB},\\mathrm{UTB},\\mathrm{CT}^{-},\\mathrm{FS},\\mathrm{KF},\\mathrm{VF}\\)</span> 为比较节点的固定版本。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\equiv_{\\mathcal C},\\prec_{\\mathcal C}\">\\(\\equiv_{\\mathcal C},\\prec_{\\mathcal C}\\)</span> 为共同后果关系。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}truth\\text{-}theory\\text{-}hierarchy}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{TB}\\equiv_{\\mathcal C}\\mathrm{UTB}\\equiv_{\\mathcal C}\\mathrm{CT}^{-}\\equiv_{\\mathcal C}\\mathrm{PA}\n\\prec_{\\mathcal C}\\mathrm{FS}\\prec_{\\mathcal C}\\mathrm{KF}\\prec_{\\mathcal C}\\mathrm{VF}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}truth\\text{-}theory\\text{-}hierarchy}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{TB}\\equiv_{\\mathcal C}\\mathrm{UTB}\\equiv_{\\mathcal C}\\mathrm{CT}^{-}\\equiv_{\\mathcal C}\\mathrm{PA}\n\\prec_{\\mathcal C}\\mathrm{FS}\\prec_{\\mathcal C}\\mathrm{KF}\\prec_{\\mathcal C}\\mathrm{VF}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>此推论直接复用已引证明定理的比较节点，不再把仅导入 FS、KF、VF 的名称当作强度证明。完整 CT 与这里的 CT<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"^-\">\\(^-\\)</span> 是不同版本。\n链限定算术后果，不给出 T 语言的公理包含、双向定义翻译或一个通用哲学“更好”顺序。</p>\n<p>来源：Theorem 7.5、Theorem 8.5、Corollary 14.32、§15.3、第 18 章。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-fact-theory-comparison","status":"resolved","id":"d0dc2670ffdd2806","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-fact-theory-comparison]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal C=\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_0}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PA},\\mathrm{TB},\\mathrm{UTB},\\mathrm{CT}^{-},\\mathrm{FS},\\mathrm{KF},\\mathrm{VF}","display":false},{"tex":"\\equiv_{\\mathcal C},\\prec_{\\mathcal C}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}truth\\text{-}theory\\text{-}hierarchy}\\vdash\\quad\n\\mathrm{TB}\\equiv_{\\mathcal C}\\mathrm{UTB}\\equiv_{\\mathcal C}\\mathrm{CT}^{-}\\equiv_{\\mathcal C}\\mathrm{PA}\n\\prec_{\\mathcal C}\\mathrm{FS}\\prec_{\\mathcal C}\\mathrm{KF}\\prec_{\\mathcal C}\\mathrm{VF}.","display":true},{"tex":"^-","display":false}],"bytes":1379,"backlinks":[{"id":"4278731e7fc892de","anchor":"ref-205","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-cor-truth-theory-hierarchy]]"},{"id":"e93fc3e2f8fd50d4","anchor":"ref-205","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-cor-truth-theory-hierarchy]]"}],"outgoing":["d0dc2670ffdd2806"]}